# Title: Remote Code Execute via Winrm.vbs
# ID: 9df0dd3a-1a5c-47e3-a2bc-30ed177646a0
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Julia Fomina, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-07
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1216
# Description: Detects an attempt to execute code or create service on remote host via winrm.vbs.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAINS "winrm" AND CommandLine CONTAINS "invoke Create wmicimv2/Win32_" AND CommandLine CONTAINS "-r:http")) AND ((Image="*\\cscript.exe") OR (OriginalFileName == "cscript.exe")))
